      "source": [
        "\n",
        "While considering the quality of a film, it is essential to take into consideration both vote_count and vote_average. A film that is based on 5 votes with a 10.0 rating might appear as higher quality than another that is based on 1000 votes with a 6.0 rating.\n",
        "\n",
        " To ensure that the estimation for quality is robust, we will implement a weighted rating system to filter out movies with high vote average and low vote count."
      ],
