        "**Inference:** At the aggregate level (All Films), both groups show similar revenue distributions. The box plot is also similar in spread and median. This suggests that facing a major studio competitor does not have a clear negative effect on box office revenues when all films are considered together for comparison. However this is misleading as the \"faced_major\" group is heavily composed of other major studio films that earns higher revenues regardless of competition.\n",
