        "####<font color = #68b383>**Multiple Linear Regression**\n",
        "\n",
        "**Goal:** To determine diagnostically which factors independently and significantly influence box office revenue after controlling for all variables simultaneously.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Method/Measure:** An OLS multiple linear regression was fitted with log-transformed box office revenue as the dependent variable.\n",
        "\n",
        "The independent variables included weighted_rating (continuous), faced_major_studio (binary: 1 = faced major studio, 0 = safe window), competitor_count (continuous), is_major_studio (binary: 1 = Major studio film, 0 = Indie film), and seasons dummy variables. Season was encoded as three binary dummy variables — Summer, Spring and Holiday. Off-Peak was set as the baseline reference category, meaning all season coefficients are interpreted relative to Off-Peak performance.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Code:** We first apply log transformation to revenue, encode binary variables as integers and ecode season as dummy variables. Then, we build the fitted model for OLS multiple linear regression."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "-tHO1PwRjBFZ"
      }
